By 2018, the machinery behind that brand had started turning on its next project.

2
00:00:05,902 --> 00:00:08,067
Internally: the next girl group.

3
00:00:08,067 --> 00:00:09,639
Externally: nothing.

4
00:00:09,639 --> 00:00:11,211
For years, nothing.

5
00:00:11,211 --> 00:00:12,835
Y-G does not leak.

6
00:00:12,835 --> 00:00:14,097
Y-G waits.

7
